page('about.html','About Us','ABOUT SHREE MENAKSHI TOOLS AND DIE MAKERS', '''<section class="section"><div class="container about-grid"><img class="about-img" src="assets/factory.jpg" alt="Industrial manufacturing facility and CNC machining"><div class="about"><div class="kicker">OUR APPROACH</div><h2>Practical. Precise. Production Oriented.</h2><p><strong>SHREE MENAKSHI TOOLS AND DIE MAKERS</strong> specializes in the design and manufacturing of precision tools, dies, moulds and production tooling for rubber, nylon, PTFE and sheet metal components.</p><p>Our approach is centered on understanding the component, selecting the right tooling concept and delivering a practical solution that supports repeatable production.</p><div class="checklist"><div class="check">✓ Precision</div><div class="check">✓ Durability</div><div class="check">✓ Repeatability</div><div class="check">✓ Dimensional Accuracy</div><div class="check">✓ Production Efficiency</div><div class="check">✓ Cost-Effective Tooling</div></div></div></div></section><section class="section light"><div class="container center"><div class="kicker">WHY WE FOCUS ON TOOLING</div><h2 class="section-title">Built Around Production Requirements</h2><div class="services"><div class="card"><div class="card-body"><h3>ENGINEERING THINKING</h3><p>Tool concepts consider part geometry, material characteristics, shrinkage and manufacturing feasibility.</p></div></div><div class="card"><div class="card-body"><h3>REPEATABLE RESULTS</h3><p>Dimensional control and robust tooling help support consistent production.</p></div></div><div class="card"><div class="card-body"><h3>CUSTOMIZED SOLUTIONS</h3><p>Tooling is developed around your component, process and production requirements.</p></div></div><div class="card"><div class="card-body"><h3>LONG-TERM VALUE</h3><p>Durable tooling and practical design support better productivity and cost effectiveness.</p></div></div></div></div></section>''')

page('services.html','Our Services','OUR CORE SERVICES', '''<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="service-detail" id="rubber"><img src="assets/rubber-moulds.jpg" alt="Rubber moulds and tooling"><div><div class="kicker">01 / RUBBER</div><h2>Rubber Moulds &amp; Tools</h2><p>Compression, transfer and injection moulding solutions for industrial rubber components, with tooling designed around repeatability, flash control and dimensional requirements.</p><ul class="service-list"><li>Compression moulds</li><li>Transfer moulds</li><li>Injection moulds</li><li>O-ring moulds</li><li>Rubber seal moulds</li><li>Gasket moulds</li><li>Bush moulds</li><li>Diaphragm moulds</li><li>Valve-seat moulds</li><li>Custom rubber component moulds</li></ul><p><strong>Materials:</strong> EPDM, NBR, HNBR, FKM/Viton, Silicone, Neoprene and other elastomers.</p></div></div><div class="service-detail" id="nylon"><img src="assets/nylon-tools.jpg" alt="Nylon component tooling"><div><div class="kicker">02 / ENGINEERING PLASTICS</div><h2>Nylon Component Tools &amp; Moulds</h2><p>Tooling for nylon components is developed with material shrinkage, part geometry, dimensional accuracy, ejection and production requirements in mind.</p><ul class="service-list"><li>Nylon bushes</li><li>Nylon washers</li><li>Nylon spacers</li><li>Nylon rollers</li><li>Nylon gears</li><li>Nylon guides</li><li>Nylon seals</li><li>Custom engineering plastic components</li></ul></div></div><div class="service-detail" id="ptfe"><img src="assets/ptfe-tools.jpg" alt="PTFE Teflon tooling and components"><div><div class="kicker">03 / PTFE</div><h2>PTFE (Teflon) Tools &amp; Moulds</h2><p>PTFE tooling considers material characteristics, forming requirements, dimensional control and demoulding for reliable production.</p><ul class="service-list"><li>PTFE seals</li><li>PTFE rings</li><li>PTFE bushes</li><li>PTFE washers</li><li>PTFE gaskets</li><li>PTFE valve components</li><li>PTFE insulation components</li><li>Custom PTFE components</li></ul></div></div><div class="service-detail" id="sheet"><img src="assets/sheet-metal.jpg" alt="Sheet metal press dies"><div><div class="kicker">04 / SHEET METAL</div><h2>Sheet Metal Dies &amp; Tools</h2><p>Production-oriented press tools and dies for cutting, forming and shaping sheet materials with attention to accuracy and tool life.</p><ul class="service-list"><li>Press tools</li><li>Progressive dies</li><li>Compound dies</li><li>Blanking dies</li><li>Punching tools</li><li>Bending tools</li><li>Forming tools</li><li>Drawing dies</li><li>Piercing tools</li><li>Cutting tools</li><li>Custom sheet metal tools</li></ul></div></div></div></section>''')

